s; export and import of products; and engineering activities. The company was formerly known as Shin-Etsu Nitrogen Fertilizer Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Shin-Etsu Chemical Co., Ltd. in 1940. Shin-Etsu Chemical Co., Ltd. was incorporated in 1926 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.","fullTimeEmployees":28239,"city":"Tokyo","country":"Japan","website":"https://www.shinetsu.co.jp","industry":"Chemicals","sector":"Basic Materials"},"news":[],"info_date":"2026-10-30"}